#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Qiskit MCP Servers to integrate quantum computing capabilities into AI "
"assistants and agents."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan Pelayan MCP Qiskit untuk mengintegrasikan keupayaan pengkomputeran "
"kuantum ke dalam pembantu AI dan ejen."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP Qiskit"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore modelcontextprotocol  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore modelcontextprotocol  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP Qiskit {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit MCP Servers is a collection of [Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) servers that integrate quantum "
"computing capabilities into AI systems. These servers enable AI assistants, "
"large language models (LLMs), and agents to access IBM Quantum&reg; services"
" and Qiskit libraries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelayan MCP Qiskit adalah koleksi pelayan [Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) yang mengintegrasikan keupayaan "
"pengkomputeran kuantum ke dalam sistem AI. Pelayan-pelayan ini membolehkan "
"pembantu AI, model bahasa besar (LLM), dan ejen untuk mengakses perkhidmatan"
" IBM Quantum&reg; dan pustaka Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an open-source project. For the most up-to-date information, detailed API coverage, and advanced configurations, refer to the [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    Ini adalah projek sumber terbuka. Untuk maklumat terkini, liputan API terperinci, dan konfigurasi lanjutan, rujuk [repositori GitHub Pelayan MCP Qiskit.](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When should I use Qiskit MCP Servers? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-mcp-"
"servers}"
msgstr ""
"Bilakah saya patut menggunakan Pelayan MCP Qiskit? {#when-should-i-use-"
"qiskit-mcp-servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit MCP Servers allow AI assistants to help you with quantum computing "
"tasks, such as the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelayan MCP Qiskit membolehkan pembantu AI membantu anda dengan tugas "
"pengkomputeran kuantum, seperti berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Creating, manipulating, and transpiling quantum circuits\n"
msgstr "Mencipta, memanipulasi, dan mentranspile litar kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Retrieving and searching Qiskit documentation, guides, and API references\n"
msgstr "Mendapatkan dan mencari dokumentasi Qiskit, panduan, dan rujukan API\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Answering quantum computing questions directly from reliable sources\n"
msgstr ""
"Menjawab soalan pengkomputeran kuantum terus dari sumber yang boleh "
"dipercayai\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Generating quantum code with contextual awareness\n"
msgstr "Menjana kod kuantum dengan kesedaran kontekstual\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Optimizing circuits using AI-powered transpilation\n"
msgstr "Mengoptimumkan litar menggunakan transpilasi berkuasa AI\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting to real quantum hardware automatically\n"
msgstr "Menyambung ke perkakasan kuantum nyata secara automatik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Analyzing and selecting optimal quantum backends\n"
msgstr "Menganalisis dan memilih backend kuantum yang optimum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Executing quantum circuits and tracking job status\n"
msgstr "Melaksanakan litar kuantum dan menjejak status kerja\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What is included? {#what-is-included}"
msgstr "Apa yang disertakan? {#what-is-included}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following MCP servers are available:\n"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP berikut tersedia:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Server {#qiskit-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP Qiskit {#qiskit-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides core quantum computing capabilities for local development. This "
"server enables AI assistants to create, manipulate, and transpile quantum "
"circuits, as well as serialize them to formats like OpenQASM 3 and QPY.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menyediakan keupayaan pengkomputeran kuantum teras untuk pembangunan "
"tempatan. Pelayan ini membolehkan pembantu AI mencipta, memanipulasi, dan "
"mentranspile litar kuantum, serta mensirikan mereka ke format seperti "
"OpenQASM 3 dan QPY.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime MCP Server {#qiskit-runtime-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP Qiskit Runtime {#qiskit-runtime-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides access to IBM Quantum cloud services through Qiskit Runtime. This "
"enables AI assistants to interact with quantum backends, submit jobs, and "
"retrieve results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menyediakan akses kepada perkhidmatan awan IBM Quantum melalui Qiskit "
"Runtime. Ini membolehkan pembantu AI berinteraksi dengan backend kuantum, "
"menghantar kerja, dan mendapatkan keputusan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Docs MCP Server {#qiskit-docs-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP Qiskit Docs {#qiskit-docs-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides AI assistants with access to the complete Qiskit documentation "
"ecosystem, including SDK module documentation, implementation guides, and "
"best practices. This server enables intelligent retrieval and search across "
"the Qiskit documentation without requiring authentication.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menyediakan pembantu AI dengan akses kepada ekosistem dokumentasi Qiskit "
"yang lengkap, termasuk dokumentasi modul SDK, panduan pelaksanaan, dan "
"amalan terbaik. Pelayan ini membolehkan pendapatan semula dan carian pintar "
"merentas dokumentasi Qiskit tanpa memerlukan pengesahan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Server {#qiskit-ibm-transpiler-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP Qiskit IBM Transpiler {#qiskit-ibm-transpiler-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides AI-powered circuit optimization through the [AI-powered transpiler "
"passes](/guides/ai-transpiler-passes). This server enables AI assistants to "
"optimize quantum circuits using advanced routing and optimization "
"algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menyediakan pengoptimuman litar berkuasa AI melalui [laluan transpiler "
"berkuasa AI](/guides/ai-transpiler-passes). Pelayan ini membolehkan pembantu"
" AI mengoptimumkan litar kuantum menggunakan algoritma penghalaan dan "
"pengoptimuman lanjutan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Community servers {#community-servers}"
msgstr "Pelayan komuniti {#community-servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following community-contributed MCP servers are also available:\n"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP yang disumbangkan komuniti berikut juga tersedia:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Gym MCP Server {#qiskit-gym-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Pelayan MCP Qiskit Gym {#qiskit-gym-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides reinforcement learning capabilities for quantum circuit synthesis "
"using the [qiskit-gym](https://github.com/AI4quantum/qiskit-gym) library. "
"This server enables AI assistants to use RL-based optimization techniques "
"for quantum circuit transpilation and synthesis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menyediakan keupayaan pembelajaran pengukuhan untuk sintesis litar kuantum "
"menggunakan pustaka [qiskit-gym](https://github.com/AI4quantum/qiskit-gym). "
"Pelayan ini membolehkan pembantu AI menggunakan teknik pengoptimuman "
"berasaskan RL untuk transpilasi dan sintesis litar kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit MCP Servers {#install-qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Pasang Pelayan MCP Qiskit {#install-qiskit-mcp-servers}"

