#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.10 or later (3.11+ recommended)\n"
msgstr "Python 3.10 atau lebih terkini (3.11+ disyorkan)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An IBM Quantum account and API token (see [Set up your IBM Cloud&reg; "
"account](/guides/cloud-setup) for instructions)\n"
msgstr ""
"Akaun IBM Quantum dan token API (lihat [Sediakan akaun IBM Cloud&reg; "
"anda](/guides/cloud-setup) untuk arahan)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install all the available Qiskit MCP servers by running the following "
"command from a terminal:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pasang semua pelayan MCP Qiskit yang tersedia dengan menjalankan arahan "
"berikut dari terminal:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install individual MCP servers:\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh memasang pelayan MCP individu:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Qiskit MCP Servers {#configure-qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Pelayan MCP Qiskit {#configure-qiskit-mcp-servers}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set environment variables {#set-environment-variables}"
msgstr "Tetapkan pemboleh ubah persekitaran {#set-environment-variables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up the required environment variables for authentication. The Qiskit MCP"
" Server and Qiskit Docs MCP Server do not require authentication.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan pemboleh ubah persekitaran yang diperlukan untuk pengesahan. "
"Pelayan MCP Qiskit dan Pelayan MCP Qiskit Docs tidak memerlukan "
"pengesahan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For the Qiskit Runtime, or Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Servers:\n"
msgstr "Untuk Pelayan MCP Qiskit Runtime, atau Qiskit IBM Transpiler:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can find your API token in your [IBM Quantum account "
"settings](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh mencari token API anda dalam [tetapan akaun IBM Quantum "
"anda.](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the MCP client {#configure-the-mcp-client}"
msgstr "Konfigurasi klien MCP {#configure-the-mcp-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can configure an MCP-compatible client (such as Claude Desktop, Cursor, "
"or other AI tools) to use the Qiskit MCP servers. The exact configuration "
"depends on your client. For example, an MCP client configuration file might "
"look like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh mengkonfigurasi klien yang serasi dengan MCP (seperti Claude "
"Desktop, Cursor, atau alatan AI lain) untuk menggunakan pelayan MCP Qiskit. "
"Konfigurasi tepat bergantung pada klien anda. Contohnya, fail konfigurasi "
"klien MCP mungkin kelihatan seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Refer to your MCP client's documentation for specific configuration "
"instructions.\n"
msgstr "Rujuk dokumentasi klien MCP anda untuk arahan konfigurasi khusus.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test the MCP servers {#test-the-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Uji pelayan MCP {#test-the-mcp-servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can test the MCP servers interactively by using the MCP Inspector:\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menguji pelayan MCP secara interaktif dengan menggunakan MCP "
"Inspector:\n"

