#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Visit the [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers) for detailed "
"documentation, API coverage, and examples.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lawati [repositori GitHub Pelayan MCP Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-"
"servers) untuk dokumentasi terperinci, liputan API, dan contoh.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn about [AI-powered transpiler passes](/guides/ai-transpiler-passes) to "
"understand the AI-powered circuit optimization capabilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ketahui tentang [laluan transpiler berkuasa AI](/guides/ai-transpiler-"
"passes) untuk memahami keupayaan pengoptimuman litar berkuasa AI.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up your [IBM Quantum account](/guides/cloud-setup) if you haven't "
"already.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan [akaun IBM Quantum](/guides/cloud-setup) anda jika belum berbuat "
"demikian.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explore the [Model Context Protocol "
"documentation](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) to learn more about MCP.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terokai [dokumentasi Model Context "
"Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) untuk mengetahui lebih lanjut "
"tentang MCP.\n"

